 ('galSpecExtra','bptclass','','','','Emission line classification based on the BPT diagram using the methodology described in Brinchmann et al (2004). -1 means unclassifiable, 1 is star-forming, 2 means low S/N star-forming, 3 is composite, 4 AGN (excluding liners) and 5 is a low S/N LINER.','0'),
 ('galSpecExtra','oh_p2p5','','','','The 2.5 percentile of the Oxygen abundance derived using Charlot &amp; Longhetti models. The values are reported as 12 + Log O/H. See Tremonti et al (2004) and Brinchmann et al (2004) for details.','0'),
