 ('galSpecExtra','oh_p84','','','','The 84th percentile of the Oxygen abundance derived using Charlot &amp; Longhetti models. The values are reported as 12 + Log O/H. See Tremonti et al (2004) and Brinchmann et al (2004) for details.','0'),
