 ('mos_gedr3spur_main','theta_arcsec_worst_source','arcsec','','','Distance to the eDR3 source within 30 arcsec of the object for which delta_g-theta is maximal. See norm_dg for details.','0'),
 ('mos_gedr3spur_main','norm_dg','','','','This is a heuristic measure for contamination by bright stars in the neighbourhood. It is computed as delta_g-theta, where theta is the distance to another Gaia eDR3 object in arcsec (reported in theta_arcsec_worst_source), and delta_g is the magnitude difference in mag. This column gives the maximum of the values for all eDR3 sources within 30 arcsecs of the object.','0'),
